'''Ludicolo''' (Japanese: '''ルンパッパ''' ''Runpappa'') is a {{ct|Water}} Stage 2 Pokémon card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It is part of the {{TCGP|Mega Rising}} expansion.

